  "details": "Hiya! Pach with Dance Dance Virtual Reality here. \n\nSo I would like to see a festival type of traversal which would allow multiple worlds to be connected between each other. \n\nThe initial large map will be sliced into sections and then distributed to world creators. \n\nCreators will build upon the land and then sent back to a single person for upload.\n\nOnce done, each map will have at least 2 portals that allow traversal to the next slice.\n\nIn this case each portal will be hard coded in editor to the ID of another world.\n\nOr.. \n\nOn the website you have the ability to look up a map in inventory, and export a code that links that portal to their respective destination, as long as you have the map in your inventory. \n\nOr..\n\nAnyone in the group's staff is able to drop multiple portals in special areas to other group locations that stay open for the life of the instance.",
